  "title": "Creative Writing Club",
  "summary": "The Creative Writing Club is a program designed for children and youth aged 10 to 17. It focuses on developing narrative writing skills in an enjoyable and motivating way. Participants will learn how to create characters, build storylines and transform ideas into lively stories. The club meets every Monday, providing a supportive environment that boosts confidence in expression and nurtures imaginative creativity. It&rsquo;s a wonderful opportunity to discover the joy of writing, develop storytelling and dialogue skills, and build imaginative worlds that reflect each participant&rsquo;s personality and ideas.",
